  "design_notes_md": "# \ud83c\udfa8 Design Notes \u2014 BASIC/DEPT\u00ae | Digital Branding &amp; Product Design Agency\n\n> **URL:** https://www.basicagency.com/  \n> **Style:** modern professional  \n> **Premium Score:** 66/100 (\ud83d\udc4d Above Average)\n\n## Quick Profile\n\n| Trait | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Mood | polished competence |\n| Era | contemporary |\n| Contrast | high-contrast |\n| Whitespace | generous |\n| Complexity | moderate |\n| Density | moderate-sparse (34/100) |\n| Whitespace Ratio | 0.607 |\n\n## Typography & Colour\n\n- **Typography prominence:** subtle\n- **Typography pattern:** standard\n- **Colour contrast:** high-contrast\n- \ud83c\udf11 **Dark theme** detected\n\n## Layout & Rhythm\n\n- **Hero type:** full-screen-with-image\n- **Section count:** 10\n- **Spacing rhythm:** dramatic-variation\n- **Content width:** full-width-sections\n- **Vertical rhythm:** generous-breathing\n\n**Section flow:** `hero \u2192 content \u2192 social-proof \u2192 content \u2192 blog \u2192 cta \u2192 footer \u2192 video-section`\n\n> Page flow: hero \u2192 content \u2192 social-proof \u2192 content \u2192 blog \u2192 cta \u2192 footer \u2192 video-section. Opens with a strong hero section, presenting core content, reinforced by social proof and testimonials, presenting core content, supplemented with blog/thought leadership content, culminating in a clear call-to-action, closing with navigation and contact information, featuring video content for engagement.\n\n### Captured Sections\n\n- `hero.png` \u2014 *hero* (1440\u00d7840)\n- `hero-2.png` \u2014 *hero* (1440\u00d71499)\n- `section-10.png` \u2014 *section-10* (1440\u00d78902)\n\n## Navigation\n\n- **Pattern (basic):** floating-transparent\n- **Style:** transparent-static\n- **Behaviour:** static\n- **Fixed:** no\n- **Backdrop blur:** no\n- **Shadow:** no\n- **Links:** 6\n- **Logo:** yes\n\n## Animation & Motion\n\n- **Approach:** clean transitions with selective motion\n- **Intensity:** dramatic\n- **Transition style:** cinematic\n- **Techniques:** css-keyframe-animations, custom-cursor\n\n### Timing Pattern: **stagger**\n\n- Animated elements: 60\n- Elements with delay: 11\n- Stagger #1: 9 elements, ~62.5ms step\n\n## \u26a1 Animation Tech Stack\n\n- **Framework renderer:** `Next.js`\n- **Stack complexity:** css-only\n\n## \ud83d\udcdc Scroll Behavior\n\n- **Frames captured:** 26\n- **Page height:** 9,927px\n- **Viewport height:** 900px\n- **Scroll GIF size:** 2814.3 KB\n- **Preview:** `motion/scroll/page-scroll-preview.gif`\n- **Pinned sections:** 11\n  - Section #1 pinned from 1620px to 4050px (16 frames)\n  - Section #2 pinned from 0px to 486px (4 frames)\n  - Section #2 pinned from 2106px to 4050px (13 frames)\n  - Section #3 pinned from 0px to 972px (7 frames)\n  - Section #3 pinned from 2754px to 4050px (9 frames)\n  - Section #4 pinned from 0px to 1782px (12 frames)\n  - Section #4 pinned from 3726px to 4050px (3 frames)\n  - Section #5 pinned from 0px to 2754px (18 frames)\n  - Section #6 pinned from 0px to 3564px (23 frames)\n  - Section #7 pinned from 162px to 4050px (25 frames)\n  - Section #8 pinned from 0px to 4050px (26 frames)\n\n### High-Animation Zones\n\n- `menu_menu__CtmVr` (0px \u2013 840px)\n- `home-intro_container__df_t_` (840px \u2013 2339px)\n- `home-overview_container__fy0XZ` (2339px \u2013 2796px)\n- `home-case-studies_container__Oupmp` (2796px \u2013 3437px)\n- `home-clients_container__NBR2A` (3437px \u2013 4269px)\n- `jsx-2547979358` (10128px \u2013 19030px)\n\n## \ud83c\udfac Motion Capture\n\n- **Animation groups detected:** 2\n- **Techniques:** translate-up-100, stagger-1\n- **Types:** keyframe, entrance\n- **GIFs recorded:** 2 (2380.5 KB total)\n- **Capture time:** 14103ms\n\n### Animation Groups\n\n- \u2605 **entrance-stagger-1** \u2014 entrance / `stagger-1` (trigger: page-load)\n  - Selectors: `div.intro-asset-wrapper_children___BE9p, li`\n- \u25cf **keyframe-translate-up-100** \u2014 keyframe / `translate-up-100` (trigger: page-load)\n  - Selectors: `span`\n\n### Recorded GIFs\n\n- `motion/animations/entrance-stagger-1.gif` \u2014 22 frames, 1191.7 KB\n- `motion/animations/keyframe-translate-up-100.gif` \u2014 15 frames, 1188.9 KB\n\n## \ud83d\uddb1 Interaction Capture\n\n- **Interactive elements detected:** 5\n- **Element types:** image, nav-link\n- **Interaction types:** hover\n- **GIFs recorded:** 1 (214.4 KB total)\n\n### Targets\n\n- \u25cf **nav-link-hover** \u2014 Navigation link hover (12 links) (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-3** \u2014 Image hover in section 3 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-4** \u2014 Image hover in section 4 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-6** \u2014 Image hover in section 6 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-9** \u2014 Image hover in section 9 (hover)\n\n### Recorded GIFs\n\n- `motion/interactions/nav-link-hover-hover.gif` \u2014 10 frames, 214.4 KB\n\n## Imagery\n\n- **Primary approach:** product-focused with high-quality renders\n- **Hero:** full-bleed-photo\n- **Background:** video-background\n- **Icons:** custom-svg-icons\n- **Density:** image-heavy\n- **Effects:** noise-texture, dark-overlay\n\n## \ud83d\uddbc Media Intelligence\n\n- **Hero media:** text-only\n- **Media density:** media-heavy\n- **Images detected:** 23\n- **Videos detected:** 2\n- **SVGs detected:** 60\n- **Icon system:** custom-mixed\n\n### Image Roles\n\n- `content`: 23\n\n### Video Usage\n\n- **content-video**\n- **content-video** (loop, muted)\n\n## Premium Patterns\n\n- floating-navbar\n- full-width-sections\n- noise-grain-texture\n- custom-cursor\n- generous-whitespace\n- dark-theme\n- pill-badges\n**Special effects:** custom-cursor, noise-texture\n\n**CTA style:** standard\n**Footer style:** cta-footer-with-form\n\n## Key Takeaways\n\n1. Study the modern professional aesthetic approach and how it creates cohesion\n2. Replicate the clean transitions with selective motion motion strategy\n3. Apply the product-focused with high-quality renders approach to visual content\n4. Implement the floating-transparent navigation pattern\n\n---\n\n*Generated by UX Analyzer \u2014 Design Intelligence Engine*",
